  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INVOLVING THE SPANISH LONG-DISTANCE FISHERIES IN THE..CONSERVATION OF THE NW ATLANTIC-NESTING LOGGERHEAD..POPULATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will; 1. conduct port and on board outreach and training for improving bycatch data and safe release and handling of sea turtles: 2. conduct fishing in the Mediterranean to test and validate the &quot;3D&quot; bycatch risk zoning tool; 3. conduct pilot fish trials to assess risk of bycatch in the Atlantic areas; and 4. film fishing operations and training workshops for outreach and education purposes.</narrative>
  </description>
